{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10033","headline":"游越溪 · 郑绍","name":"游越溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪水碧悠悠，猨声断客愁。\n渔潭逢钓楫，月浦值孤舟。\n访泊随烟火，迷途视斗牛。\n今宵越乡意，还取醉忘忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}